      "text": {
        "en": "Clients speak warmly of veterinarians including Dr McGuire, Dr Chandrasekar, and Dr Awasthi, highlighting their patience, empathy, and collaborative approach to animal health. Reviewers value that doctors outline varied treatment options without pressure, though one former client reported a historical misdiagnosis of canine pneumonia."
