        "en": "Effective surgeries and reliable recoveries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet guardians report strong recovery outcomes following critical surgical procedures, such as emergency pyometra treatment in a senior dog, anal gland abscess drainage, and mass removals. Reviewers appreciate that veterinary teams initiate prompt follow-up calls and detailed text updates to monitor postoperative healing progress."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear consultations and digital follow-up"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the convenient online appointment scheduling and written summaries provided after consultations. Clients also praise the in-room checkout system and rapid digital messaging for prescription refills, which significantly simplifies managing ongoing treatments for unwell pets."
      }
    }
